{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a factory that gets increasingly automated. The output of the factory is used to create and upgrade a planet-splitting drill that consumes massive amounts of energy. Craft Combat Units and watch them fight for control over enemy controlled sites like Power Plants, design the system that wins the war, all via logistics. Balance your production carefully with energy consumption and automate everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/e9bb1763ca7d585d135f58cde45cb0cc.avif?t=1769253508\" width=780 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start small with manual mining and grow your factory to automate everything</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/9b9d9610ff4698afeb6ab604148be3b1.poster.avif?t=1769253508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/9b9d9610ff4698afeb6ab604148be3b1.webm?t=1769253508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/9b9d9610ff4698afeb6ab604148be3b1.mp4?t=1769253508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/5ce67415c91e49f1911aa925deb3691f.avif?t=1769253508\" width=780 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The procedurally generated sandbox worlds allow you to create your own factory layout in any way imaginable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/9ec478f3c5cc3d46cb189e4c34a0179c.poster.avif?t=1769253508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/9ec478f3c5cc3d46cb189e4c34a0179c.webm?t=1769253508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/9ec478f3c5cc3d46cb189e4c34a0179c.mp4?t=1769253508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/787bc1f17297074f40cfb72f9b1279ea.avif?t=1769253508\" width=780 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Move units to enemy sites and capture them via auto-battle mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/0e8cad6a717455389cc2eb29f2de96be.poster.avif?t=1769253508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/0e8cad6a717455389cc2eb29f2de96be.webm?t=1769253508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/0e8cad6a717455389cc2eb29f2de96be.mp4?t=1769253508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/757b1180e4f446d7fe6382d560eb59bb.avif?t=1769253508\" width=780 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use the Core Splitter Drill to drill down into the world, break through harder layers and split the core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/eacaaff5941b7c8ee94348b3cd219c10.poster.avif?t=1769253508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/eacaaff5941b7c8ee94348b3cd219c10.webm?t=1769253508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/eacaaff5941b7c8ee94348b3cd219c10.mp4?t=1769253508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/de033b08a3bacb627ec4a982b09e1d16.avif?t=1769253508\" width=723 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core splitter is made as a parttime project by a  solo indie developer including music, art, assets, programming and story. The game takes  inspiration from Factorio and Satisfactory which are some of my favorite all time games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Core Splitter is <u><strong>not</strong></u>:<br><br>A multiplayer experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Coop experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A moddable experience</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075990?t=1769253508","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/766bbcc9690dda6f6f419514b399be5f499efeb8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769253508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/adcc74d9e865eb88dd7df75ed08084e8418c4127/capsul